ProtocolFeeCollector::setSdusdVault
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when new sDUSD vault is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorZeroAddress
    ├── when new sDUSD vault equals the current vault
    │   └── it should revert with ProtocolFeeCollectorNoStateChange
    └── when new sDUSD vault is valid and different
        ├── it should update sdusdVault
        └── it should emit SdusdUpdated
